OL,3,GNEWSAMan appears in court after police
OL,4,Aofficer shot
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court in
OL,7,Fconnection with the shooting of a
OL,8,Fpolice officer in Nottingham city
OL,9,Fcentre.
OL,11,FPC Lee Lane was shot in the foot after
OL,12,Fapproaching two suspects at a bus stop
OL,13,Fin Angel Row shortly before 04:50 BST
OL,14,Fon 18 October.
OL,16,FOn Wednesday Lea Anderson became the
OL,17,Fthird person to be charged over the
OL,18,Fshooting, accused of possession of a
OL,19,Ffirearm to endanger life, possession of
OL,20,Fa firearm with intent to cause fear of
OL,21,Fviolence, and possession of a
OL,22,Fprohibited weapon.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
