OL,3,GNEWSAMan appears in court after police
OL,4,Aofficer shot
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 31-year-old, of Commercial Road in
OL,7,FNottingham, appeared at Nottingham
OL,8,FMagistrates' Court on Thursday, and was
OL,9,Fremanded into custody ahead of his next
OL,10,Fscheduled appearance at Nottingham
OL,11,FCrown Court on 20 November.
